Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Feeling used, but I\'m\nStill missing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:12.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And I can't see the end of this\nJust wanna feel your kiss against my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:18.10,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And now all this time is passing by\nBut I still can't seem to tell you why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:21.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}It hurts me every time I see you\nRealize how much I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.30,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I love you\nDon't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:33.30,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}But I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:35.90,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:41.10,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I want you\nYou want her, you need her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:44.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And I'll never be her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:51.90,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I miss you when I can't sleep\nOr right after coffee, or right when I can't eat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:57.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I miss you in my front seat\nStill got sand in my sweaters from nights we don't remember
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:02.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Do you miss me like I miss you?\nFucked around and got attached to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:07.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Friends can break your heart too, and\nI'm always tired but never of you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:13.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}If I pulled a you on you, you wouldn't like that shit\nI put this reel out, but you wouldn't bite that shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:18.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I type a text but then I never mind that shit\nI got these feelings but you never mind that shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:23.08,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Oh oh, keep it on the low\nYou're still in love with me but your friends don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:28.28,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}If you wanted me you would just say so\nAnd if I were you, I would never let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:33.30,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I don't mean no harm\nI just miss you on my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:38.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Wedding bells were just alarms\nCaution tape around my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:43.66,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}You ever wonder what we could've been?\nYou said you wouldn't and you fucking did
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:49.48,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Lie to me, lie with me, get your fucking fix\nNow all my drinks and all my feelings are all fucking mixed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:54.16,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Always missing people that I shouldn't be missing\nSometimes you gotta burn some bridges just to create some distance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:59.60,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I know that I control my thoughts, and I should stop reminiscing\nBut I learned from my dad that it's good to have feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:04.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}When love and trust are gone\nI guess this is moving on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:09.90,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Everyone I do right does me wrong\nSo every lonely night, I sing this song
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:12.44,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.10,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:20.30,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Don't want to, but I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:22.86,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I want you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.04,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}You want her, you need her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:31.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And I'll never be her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:42.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}All alone I watch you watch her\nLike she's the only girl you've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:53.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}You don't care, you never did\nYou don't give a damn about me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:03:03.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Yeah, all alone I watch you watch her\nShe's the only thing you've ever seen
